    <h1>Rust</h1>
    <p>Rust is a general-purpose programming language which emphasizes performance, type safety, concurrency, and memory safety.</p>
    <p>Rust was influenced by ideas from functional programming, including immutability, higher-order functions, algebraic data types, and pattern matching.</p>
